---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { legal } from '../../config/legal';
---

<LegalLayout lang="en" title="Privacy notice" alternates={{ it: '/privacy/', en: '/en/privacy/' }}>
  <p>Information under Article 13 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR).</p>

  <h2>Data controller</h2>
  <p>
    {legal.owner}{legal.address && `, ${legal.address}`}. Email: <a href={`mailto:${legal.email}`}>{legal.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Data processed and purposes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Request form</strong>: name, email, period of interest, number of adults and children, country and
      message. We use them to answer your request and send you the programme and a quote. Legal basis: pre-contractual
      steps taken at your request (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>News about upcoming seasons</strong>: your email, only if you tick the box. Legal basis: consent (Art.
      6(1)(a) GDPR), which you can withdraw at any time without consequences.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Technical data</strong> (e.g. IP address), logged by the hosting provider to keep the website secure.
      Legal basis: legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Visit statistics</strong>, collected in aggregate form with Cloudflare Web Analytics, without cookies and
      without identifying visitors. Legal basis: legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>The required form fields are needed to answer you: without them we cannot follow up on your request.</p>

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>Request data is kept for up to 24 months from our last contact; data for news until you withdraw your consent.</p>

  <h2>Recipients</h2>
  <p>
    Data is processed by the controller and by the website's technical providers, acting as data processors:
    Cloudflare, Inc. (hosting and statistics) and Formspree, Inc. (request form handling). It is never sold or disclosed.
    Both providers are based in the United States: data is transferred with the safeguards required by Articles 44 et
    seq. GDPR, such as the EU–US Data Privacy Framework or standard contractual clauses.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This website does not use profiling cookies or third-party cookies.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to access, correct, delete, restrict or port your data, or object to its processing, by writing to{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${legal.email}`}>{legal.email}</a>. You can also lodge a complaint with the Italian data protection
    authority, the{' '}
    <a href="https://www.garanteprivacy.it" rel="noopener">Garante per la protezione dei dati personali</a>, or with
    the authority in your own country.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
